{"1756100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Who The Fuck Ate Grandma ?", "steam_appid": 1756100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Who the fuck ate Grandma?&quot; is an adventure game inspired by the famous 90s point&amp;click games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to find out who could have devoured your Grandma during a memorable family dinner…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Story</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandma’s 93rd birthday is in full swing when the unthinkable happens: Grandma is there, served as the main course, floating in barbecue sauce and accompanied by a few small pickles. Dive into a mystery where twists will be numerous, and carry out the investigation to unmask the culprit among the members of a family, all more suspicious than the others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gameplay</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the great classics of point&amp;click games, the game is based on a classic interface built around interactions between objects, inventory, and dialogue with characters. Explore the family house, interact with your environment, and solve (more or less logical) puzzles to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place mainly in the family home, and it has a fairly short length and really depends on how much time you spend solving the puzzles yourself (3-8 hours). Following a walkthrough, the game can be completed in a few hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Suspects</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth, you will need to discover the members of this eccentric family:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toby: A strange boy, obsessed with his dinosaur card collection.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/12bd33064d43e91b22d7f0193ee92b09.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/12bd33064d43e91b22d7f0193ee92b09.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bertrand: The eldest brother of the family, very hot tempered, legend says he has been chewing the same piece of gum for a year.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/7b9b4b53c52ac4054bafac8f040aab28.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/7b9b4b53c52ac4054bafac8f040aab28.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rene: The self proclaimed specialist in vegan sausages. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/da9bf08c8cd5b5faf157d6c72ebb740f.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/da9bf08c8cd5b5faf157d6c72ebb740f.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Josiane and Gustave: A couple in which personal interests seem to take priority over love.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/30b7592d4706d5679c673a74ff56ad51.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/30b7592d4706d5679c673a74ff56ad51.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/76d0dd671f28fb92ed3848a68c2d5b2c.webp?t=1777135039\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/76d0dd671f28fb92ed3848a68c2d5b2c.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=108 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witnesses: Chirac the dog, Jerry the parrot, and many other quirky characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/45e6449b738dfdea0f95b67b8076858d.webp?t=1777135039\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/45e6449b738dfdea0f95b67b8076858d.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=72 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game was developed entirely solo. Thank you for your support and your feedback.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Who the fuck ate Grandma?&quot; is an adventure game inspired by the famous 90s point&amp;click games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to find out who could have devoured your Grandma during a memorable family dinner…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Story</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grandma’s 93rd birthday is in full swing when the unthinkable happens: Grandma is there, served as the main course, floating in barbecue sauce and accompanied by a few small pickles. Dive into a mystery where twists will be numerous, and carry out the investigation to unmask the culprit among the members of a family, all more suspicious than the others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Gameplay</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the great classics of point&amp;click games, the game is based on a classic interface built around interactions between objects, inventory, and dialogue with characters. Explore the family house, interact with your environment, and solve (more or less logical) puzzles to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place mainly in the family home, and it has a fairly short length and really depends on how much time you spend solving the puzzles yourself (3-8 hours). Following a walkthrough, the game can be completed in a few hours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Suspects</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth, you will need to discover the members of this eccentric family:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toby: A strange boy, obsessed with his dinosaur card collection.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/12bd33064d43e91b22d7f0193ee92b09.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/12bd33064d43e91b22d7f0193ee92b09.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bertrand: The eldest brother of the family, very hot tempered, legend says he has been chewing the same piece of gum for a year.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/7b9b4b53c52ac4054bafac8f040aab28.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/7b9b4b53c52ac4054bafac8f040aab28.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rene: The self proclaimed specialist in vegan sausages. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/da9bf08c8cd5b5faf157d6c72ebb740f.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/da9bf08c8cd5b5faf157d6c72ebb740f.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Josiane and Gustave: A couple in which personal interests seem to take priority over love.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/30b7592d4706d5679c673a74ff56ad51.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/30b7592d4706d5679c673a74ff56ad51.webm?t=1777135039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/76d0dd671f28fb92ed3848a68c2d5b2c.webp?t=1777135039\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/76d0dd671f28fb92ed3848a68c2d5b2c.poster.avif?t=1777135039\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=108 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witnesses: Chirac the dog, Jerry the parrot, and many other quirky characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756100/extras/45e6449b738dfdea0f95b67b8